---
// One request = one transaction. Lane 1 commits; lane 2 hits ValueError
// after two INSERTs and rolls everything back. Numbers are from the capture
// in the post (stats: 1 case, not 3).
const W = 900, H = 330;
const ok = ['BEGIN', 'SELECT count(*)', 'INSERT C-1', 'COMMIT'];
const bad = ['BEGIN', 'INSERT C-2', 'INSERT C-3', 'ValueError', 'ROLLBACK'];
---
<figure class="bep5b">
  <div class="bep5b-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Two rows of steps. POST /cases: BEGIN, SELECT count, INSERT C-1, COMMIT. POST /cases/batch: BEGIN, INSERT C-2, INSERT C-3, ValueError raised, ROLLBACK, so the table keeps 1 row.">
    <text x="40" y="28" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>request succeeds: POST /cases</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request thành công: POST /cases</tspan>
    </text>
    {ok.map((s, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={40 + i * 170} y="44" width="130" height="42" rx="8" class={i === 3 ? 'good' : 'box'} />
        <text x={105 + i * 170} y="70" text-anchor="middle" class="mono">{s}</text>
        {i < 3 && (
          <g>
            <line x1={170 + i * 170} y1="65" x2={198 + i * 170} y2="65" class="ln" />
            <polygon points={`${208 + i * 170},65 ${198 + i * 170},60 ${198 + i * 170},70`} class="hd" />
          </g>
        )}
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="40" y="130" class="sub">
      <tspan data-lang-en>one transaction, all writes become visible together</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>một transaction, mọi lệnh ghi cùng hiện ra một lúc</tspan>
    </text>

    <text x="40" y="190" class="h">
      <tspan data-lang-en>request fails: POST /cases/batch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>request lỗi: POST /cases/batch</tspan>
    </text>
    {bad.map((s, i) => (
      <g>
        <rect x={40 + i * 170} y="206" width="130" height="42" rx="8" class={i === 3 ? 'bad' : i === 4 ? 'box' : 'box'} />
        <text x={105 + i * 170} y="232" text-anchor="middle" class={i === 3 ? 'mono redt' : 'mono'}>{s}</text>
        {i < 4 && (
          <g>
            <line x1={170 + i * 170} y1="227" x2={198 + i * 170} y2="227" class="ln" />
            <polygon points={`${208 + i * 170},227 ${198 + i * 170},222 ${198 + i * 170},232`} class="hd" />
          </g>
        )}
      </g>
    ))}
    <text x="40" y="292" class="redt">
      <tspan data-lang-en>blank title on the 3rd item: the two INSERTs vanish, GET /stats still says 1 case</tspan>
      <tspan data-lang-vi>title rỗng ở phần tử thứ 3: hai lệnh INSERT biến mất, GET /stats vẫn báo 1 case</tspan>
    </text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The session is the unit of work. Commit on the way out if nothing raised, roll back if anything did: the endpoint never mentions either.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Session là đơn vị công việc. Không lỗi thì commit lúc ra, có lỗi thì rollback: endpoint không phải nhắc tới cái nào.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5b { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5b-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5b svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5b text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5b .h { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 15px; }
  .bep5b .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5b .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5b .mono { font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', ui-monospace, monospace; font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5b .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5b .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5b .good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .bep5b .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5b .badfill { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5b .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5b .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5b .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5b .goodt { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5b figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
